{"page":102,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:148","surah":4,"ayah":148,"ar_uthmani":"۞ لَّا يُحِبُّ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْجَهْرَ بِٱلسُّوٓءِ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْلِ إِلَّا مَن ظُلِمَ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ سَمِيعًا عَلِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God does not like bad words to be made public unless someone has been wronged: He is all hearing and all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لَّا","en_gloss":"(Does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْجَهْرَ","en_gloss":"the public mention","transliteration":"l-jahra","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","en_gloss":"of [the] evil","transliteration":"bil-sūi","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلِ","en_gloss":"[the] words","transliteration":"l-qawli","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(by the one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ظُلِمَ ۚ","en_gloss":"has been wronged","transliteration":"ẓulima","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَمِيعًا","en_gloss":"All-Hearing","transliteration":"samīʿan","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلِيمًا","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīman","verse_key":"4:148"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٤٨","en_gloss":"(148)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:148"}]},{"verse_key":"4:149","surah":4,"ayah":149,"ar_uthmani":"إِن تُبْدُوا۟ خَيْرًا أَوْ تُخْفُوهُ أَوْ تَعْفُوا۟ عَن سُوٓءٍ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَفُوًّا قَدِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you do good, openly or in secret, or