rse_key":"4:150"},{"pos":22,"ar":"سَبِيلًا","en_gloss":"a way","transliteration":"sabīlan","verse_key":"4:150"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٥٠","en_gloss":"(150)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:150"}]},{"verse_key":"4:151","surah":4,"ayah":151,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ حَقًّا ۚ وَأَعْتَدْنَا لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ عَذَابًا مُّهِينًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they are really disbelievers: We have prepared a humiliating punishment for those who disbelieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirūna","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَقًّۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"truly","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَعْتَدْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿtadnā","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُّهِينًۭا","en_gloss":"humiliating","transliteration":"muhīnan","verse_key":"4:151"},{"pos":9,"ar":"١٥١","en_gloss":"(151)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:151"}]},{"verse_key":"4:152","surah":4,"ayah":152,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرُسُلِهِۦ وَلَمْ يُفَرِّقُوا۟ بَيْنَ أَحَدٍ مِّنْهُمْ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ سَوْفَ يُؤْتِيهِمْ أُجُورَهُمْ ۗ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But God will give [due] rewards to those who believe in Him and His messengers and make no distinction between any of them. God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"4:152"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration"