طَـٰنًا مُّبِينًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The People of the Book demand that you [Prophet] make a book physically come down to them from heaven, but they demanded even more than that of Moses when they said, ‘Show us God face to face,’ and were struck by the thunderbolt for their presumption. Even after clear revelations had come down to them, they took the calf as an object of worship, yet We pardoned this, and gave Moses clear authority;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَسْـَٔلُكَ","en_gloss":"Ask you","transliteration":"yasaluka","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَهْلُ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahlu","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُنَزِّلَ","en_gloss":"you bring down","transliteration":"tunazzila","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en_gloss":"a book","transliteration":"kitāban","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Then indeed","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَأَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they (had) asked","transliteration":"sa-alū","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Musa","transliteration":"mūsā","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَكْبَرَ","en_gloss":"greater","transliteration":"akbara","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"for they said","transliteration":"faqālū","verse_key":"4:153"},{"pos